      189.57,
      203.93,
      374.12,
      228.59
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE URBAN COUNCILS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 255)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      244.13,
      401.9,
      268.79
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      284.33,
      401.86,
      308.99
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Urban Councils(Amendment) Act, No.............. of 2023.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      324.53,
      401.89,
      389.39
    ],
    "text": "2. The following section to be inserted immediatelyfollowing Section 10(2)(b) of the No. 61 of 1939 UrbanCouncils Ordinance as amended by Act, No. 18 of 1987(Chapter 255) and shall have effect as Section 10 (2) (c) ofthat enactment :-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      174.81,
      404.57,
      401.9,
      506.87
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(c) Where a Local Authority election is declared andthe said election cannot be held due to a crisis thathas arisen, the relevant dissolved local authority/body may be reconvened by the Minister for a periodas decided at the Minister\u2019s discretionnotwithstanding the lapse of the twelve (12) months,extension made by the Minister in terms ofSection 10 (2)(b) .\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      520.97,
      401.85,
      544.91
    ],
    "text": "3. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
